{% card "Building a Community", "prose" %}
  <p>In 2020 I started creating content on Twitch as a hobby, and I successfully built a growing community around: (as of 2021)</p>
  <ul>
    <li><a href="https://www.twitch.tv/{{ site.social.twitch }}">Twitch affiliate channel</a> with 538 followers &amp; 19 subscribers.</li>
    <li><a href="http://discord.gg/eZVpkjhb">Discord</a> server with 224 people</li>
    <li>
      <a href="https://www.youtube.com/channel/{{ site.social.youtube }}">YouTube</a> channel with {{ yt.subscriberCount | default('…') }} subs,
      {{ yt.videoCount }} videos, {{ yt.viewCount }} total views!
    </li>
  </ul>
  <p>Maybe not the greatest numbers out there, but I'm proud nonetheless :)</p>
  <p>The types of content I make include <b>teaching programming to beginners</b>, <b>StarCraft II</b> gameplay/analysis/improvement, and <b>live game development</b> for fun. Below you can find some highlights and links to my content (mostly in Turkish).</p>
{% endcard %}

